{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#854","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#854","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#854\",\"parent_revision\":\"b1f755485855cdcff13401c620c6e7a7be6d1e9922143f55d0597ce282e4c9ee\",\"root_revision\":\"b1f755485855cdcff13401c620c6e7a7be6d1e9922143f55d0597ce282e4c9ee\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: \\ntype: Feature\\nstatus: closed\\nadded: \\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nThe `vm_job_step` tool currently accepts a basic step description. It needs `intent`, `reason`, `action`, `outcome` (success/failed/blocked/skipped), `outcome_detail`, `issue_classification` (user-facing/harness/environment/null), `resolution`, `evidence` (screenshot, terminal, tui_capture, shell_output up to 4096 chars, recording_timestamp), and `next` fields to support the declare-execute-reflect loop. This is the foundational data model change that all Phase 1 work depends on.\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- [ ] Work matches description\\n- [ ] Plan or implementation complete\\n</div>\\n\\n## Story\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nAs a **developer using Claude Code skills**, I want to **extend `vm_job_step` with declare-execute-reflect fields** so that **the tooling becomes more capable and complete**.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: PRD-vm-flightsimulator-v2\\n- **Priority**: P0\\n- **Added**: 2026-03-20\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"6aacc023de5c8139c84661ec3883bda1d9ca0ab5baab73673efbae776e4a063d\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABVDDNvw\"}"}